Z||000005||Nashco||04-04-2001||01:47 AM||||Sounds like a very cool idea, I wish I had access to a CNC machine!  I think a machined aluminum one would be nice, with GT or Fiero in it.  But, judging from the cost of most of your stuff, and the level of machining required for something like this, I think it'd be way out of my league.  I'm going to have to stick to my plan of making an aluminum scoop from sheet...just have to find access to a TIG welder <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||9
