Z||000007||WKDFIRO||04-04-2001||04:09 AM||||I would think that a brushed aluminum grill would be nice, and even maybe a grill of polished rods could be really classy. <P>But I would have to see one with an emblem on it to see how it would look...there isn't a lot of space on the grill to do much. And having the grill and RAM AIR seems to be a paradox! LOL.<P>Me actually buying one? <BR>Nah, I just never cared for the stock grill.<P>I would make a trip out there to see a prototype though!<p>[This message has been edited by WKDFIRO (edited 04-04-2001).]||||reg||14
